ov5693: add register/status sysfs interface

Expose the OV5693 registers needed to tell whether the sensor is
actually streaming: generic 16-bit reg access, named register dump,
exposure/gain/frame-length decode, 0x0100 stream state and a
one-shot status verdict.

--- a/drivers/media/i2c/ov5693.c
+++ b/drivers/media/i2c/ov5693.c
